    "name": "RiBeat!",
    "steam_appid": 2603750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOP TO THE BEAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RiBeat!</strong> is a challenging rhythm-puzzle game where you move to the beat of the music. Hop through a colorful world where every obstacles\u2014spikes, lightning rods, and more\u2014moves in sync with the rhythm.\u00a0Stay in sync\u2014or get struck by the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES WITH A MUSICAL TWIST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a test of both rhythm and wits. You'll need to read the obstacles, predict patterns, and time your moves precisely to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE IN MUSICAL SHOWDOWNS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a groovy gang of animal musicians in one-on-one rhythm duels. Each boss has a unique instrument, theme song, and beat-synced attacks that'll keep you dancing\u2014and dodging!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2c674be573976465d93ded43defbbe8b.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOP TO THE BEAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RiBeat!</strong> is a challenging rhythm-puzzle game where you move to the beat of the music. Hop through a colorful world where every obstacles\u2014spikes, lightning rods, and more\u2014moves in sync with the rhythm.\u00a0Stay in sync\u2014or get struck by the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/2d05463dba4f6b0511e6a6d77435150a.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PUZZLES WITH A MUSICAL TWIST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a test of both rhythm and wits. You'll need to read the obstacles, predict patterns, and time your moves precisely to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.poster.avif?t=1754840334\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.webm?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603750/extras/0a7b93f435a6466645aa423165f57e9b.mp4?t=1754840334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE IN MUSICAL SHOWDOWNS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a groovy gang of animal musicians in one-on-one rhythm duels. Each boss has a unique instrument, theme song, and beat-synced attacks that'll keep you dancing\u2014and dodging!</p>",
    "short_description": "RiBeat! is a challenging rhythm-puzzle game where you move to the beat of the music while avoiding obstacles, solving puzzles, and jamming out in musical showdowns. Bob your head to catchy tunes as Muira, the musical frog, embarks on a groovy adventure in a world that syncs with the rhythm!",
